

Uhlelo ukuphathwa-kwenkumbulo: 4.

>> i := 0.
Okuphumayo bhala: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], umugqa-omusha.
{ Okuphumayo bhala: i, umugqa-omusha. } ngenkathi: { i engeza: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Okuphumayo bhala: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], umugqa-omusha.
{ Okuphumayo bhala: i, umugqa-omusha. } ngenkathi: { i khipha: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
